     "value": "Three visual activation tasks were presented over separate scanning runs: low-calorie foods, high-calorie foods, and nonedible food-related utensils. Each paradigm lasted for 150 sec, consisting of two 30-sec stimulation periods that alternated with three control blocks of equal duration.",
